+Completion criterion: `.scratch/c1-declared/validate_results.py` exits zero on
+`.scratch/c1-declared/results.json`, with both requested worlds, at least 60
+distinct exact-path anchors, exact base-action gauge and decomposition
+residuals, LOAO and LOWO level-R2/order/top-1 metrics for every requested
+reference, widened-head and high-capacity evidence, and 16 slot permutation
+importances.
+
+Constraints: use only `/home/sat/mcrl-leo-handover/.venv/bin/python`; never
+modify that checkout or environment; use at most three concurrent Python
+processes under `nice -n 15` with every BLAS thread count set to one; do not
+run the production trainer, policy, or acceptance suite and do not change any
+sealed value.
